test "the auto-class API forwarding its own parameter is the documented opt-in route"
  lang python
  profile library
  reject VYQL-INJ-277
  reject_review code.LoadedDataControlsCodeExecutionOptIn
  file src/transformers/models/auto/configuration_auto.py
  code
  ```
  from transformers import AutoConfig


  def from_pretrained(self, pretrained_model_name_or_path, trust_remote_code=False, **kwargs):
      config = AutoConfig.from_pretrained(
          pretrained_model_name_or_path, trust_remote_code=trust_remote_code, **kwargs
      )
      return config
  ```

